    "tags": [],
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Tier 1 — Storm Wardens</strong></p><p><strong>“Weather is only random if nobody is in charge.”</strong></p><p>Storm Wardens treat wind, flood, ashfall, and static like administrative problems. They know how to ride a storm front, ground a lightning field, and keep a faction moving when the world is trying to turn travel into a funeral.</p><p><em>You’ve learned the first law of bad weather: panic is usually deadlier than the rain.</em></p><ul><li><strong>Tactical:</strong> You gain a skill rank in Lore and Faith.</li><li><strong>Strategic:</strong> In hazardous weather or corrupted environmental conditions, your faction reduces travel and exposure penalties.</li></ul>",
      "chat": ""
    },
